---

This product adopts the terminal design grammar and the theme file format of
btop (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop), Copyright 2021 Aristocratos,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically:

  - The braille and block graph symbol tables, which pack two samples per
    character cell at five levels each. skein's table is asserted identical to
    btop's, character for character, in test/render.test.js.
  - The border grammar: title inset into the top edge, state and labelled
    controls into the bottom, superscript keybind markers, and a clock in the
    top-right.
  - The theme file format, `theme[key]="#rrggbb"`, including the convention
    that an empty `main_bg` means "inherit the terminal background". skein
    reads btop's .theme files unmodified and looks for them in btop's own
    directories, so a theme installed for btop works here with no porting.

No btop source code is used. The techniques above were derived by reading
btop's published source and its theme data, both Apache-2.0.

skein is also conceptually indebted to agtop (https://github.com/ldegio/agtop),
which proved this category is wanted. agtop is GPL-2.0 and its source is
deliberately unread; the visual grammar here comes from btop, which is agtop's
own ancestor.
